</head><body>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/basic_addition.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>
<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 24 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">四則混合</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">加減乘除 · 先乘除後加減 · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 「先乘除後加減」係鐵律！由左到右做會錯！<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>L21-L23 Multiplication進階及Division應用<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 掌握運算次序 ❷ 括號優先 ❸ 混合計算 ❹ 文字題列式<br/>
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維》3下A冊 單元四
</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div></div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>8 + 5 x 3 = ？A. 39 B. 23 C. 19（邊個先？Addition定Multiplication？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>16 - 4 x 2 = ？A. 24 B. 8 C. 12</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>20 ÷ 5 + 3 = ？A. 7 B. 2.5 C. 4</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>(8 + 5) x 3 = ？（有括號！要點處理？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>小明說：「12 + 8 ÷ 2 = 10。」你同意嗎？點解？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：先乘除，後加減<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐ 最重要·四則鐵律</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>運算次序 = 數學王國嘅交通規則！</strong><br/>
② 規則一：<strong>先乘除，後加減</strong>（唔係由左到右！）<br/>
③ 規則二：<strong>有括號 → 先計括號入面</strong><br/>
④ 規則三：只有加減 / 只有乘除 → <strong>由左到右</strong><br/>
⑤ <strong>Mnemonic：</strong>「括號行先，乘除跟尾，加減最後！」
</div></div>
<div class="priority-box">
<div class="big">1st 括號 ( )</div>
<div style="font-size:18px;margin:4px 0;">↓</div>
<div class="big">2nd 乘除 x ÷</div>
<div style="font-size:18px;margin:4px 0;">↓</div>
<div class="big">3rd 加減 + -</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;margin-top:8px;color:var(--gray);">只有加減 / 只有乘除 → 由左到右</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：先乘除後加減</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算：5 + 3 x 4 = ？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">步驟：3 x 4 = 12（先乘！）<br/>5 + 12 = <strong>17</strong><br/>
<span style="color:var(--red);">唔係</span> 8 x 4 = 32（由左到右 = 錯！）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 2：有減有乘</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">20 - 3 x 5 = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 小Trap怪獸話</div><div class="eq">20 - 3 = 17，17x5 = 85</div><div class="why">由左到右做！破壞咗規則！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確答案</div><div class="eq">20 - 15 = 5</div><div class="why">先乘：3x5=15，後減：20-15=5</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 終極Trap：見到加減乘除混合，唔好心急由左到右！永遠記住：乘除係VIP，要優先處理！</div>
<div class="lf-tip">💡 視覺化提示：用唔同顏色螢光筆 —— 黃色：括號、粉紅：乘除（先做）、綠色：加減（後做）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>7 + 6 x 2 = ？（先做Multiplication！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>30 - 18 ÷ 6 = ？（先做Division！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>15 + 12 ÷ 3 - 4 = ？（先除，再加減由左到右）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>8 x 3 + 24 ÷ 6 = ？（又有乘又有除，都優先！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：括號的力量<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>括號 () = 最高優先權！</strong>入面嘅嘢要先計！<br/>
② 例：(5 + 3) x 4 = 8 x 4 = <strong>32</strong>（vs 5+3x4=17）<br/>
③ 括號可以<strong>改變運算次序</strong>！<br/>
④ 多層括號：先用最入面嗰層<br/>
⑤ <strong>文字題列式時</strong>：需要先加減嘅部分要加括號！
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 3：括號 vs 冇括號</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">比較：(12 - 4) x 3 和 12 - 4 x 3</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;"><strong>(12 - 4) x 3</strong> = 8 x 3 = <strong>24</strong> ← 先做括號<br/><strong>12 - 4 x 3</strong> = 12 - 12 = <strong>0</strong> ← 先做Multiplication<br/>有冇括號，答案完全唔同！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 4：文字題要加括號</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">🍎 小明有 50 元，買了 3 個蘋果，每個 8 元。還剩多少元？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">50 - 3 x 8</div><div class="why">呢條式係啱嘅！因為先乘除後加減，3x8會先做。但小心：50-3x8=50-24=26 ✓</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 都可以寫</div><div class="eq">50 - (3 x 8) = 26</div><div class="why">加咗括號仲清楚！但唔加都得，因為Multiplication本來就優先</div></div>
</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:6px;">真正需要括號嘅例子：蘋果每個 8 元，橙每個 5 元，買 3 個蘋果和 2 個橙共多少元？→ <strong>(3x8) + (2x5)</strong> 或 <strong>3x8 + 2x5</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>(24 + 16) ÷ 8 = ？（先做括號入面！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>36 ÷ (12 - 6) = ？（括號優先！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>(15 + 9) ÷ 3 x 2 = ？（先括號，再由左到右）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：Word Problems列式<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① Word Problems需要將<strong>文字翻譯成算式</strong><br/>
② 「共」→ 通常係Addition（要睇前文後理）<br/>
③ 「每個 / 每人」x 數量 → Multiplication先做，有需要時加括號<br/>
④ 列式時要<strong>反映正確嘅運算次序</strong>
</div></div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>9 + 4 x 5 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>36 ÷ 4 + 7 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>(18 + 6) ÷ 3 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>50 - 6 x 7 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>72 ÷ 9 + 5 x 4 = ？（乘除都優先！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>100 - (45 + 15) ÷ 5 = ？（先括號，再除，最後減）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>(8 + 12) x (15 - 7) ÷ 4 = ？（兩個括號！）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>買 5 本書每本 9 元，付 100 元，找回多少元？（列式計算）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>小明有 24 粒糖，小美有的糖是小明的 3 倍少 8 粒。小美有多少粒糖？（列式）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">四、生活Word Problems（共 5 題）<span class="star">🎯</span></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>📚 書架有 4 層，每層 9 本書，再加枱上 15 本。共有幾本？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>💰 有 80 元，買 6 支筆每支 7 元，剩多少元？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>🍕 一個 Pizza 切 8 件，叫了 3 個 Pizza，22 人每人吃一件。剩幾件？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>🎂 蛋糕每個 68 元，買 2 個，付 150 元。夠唔夠？差幾多？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>🚌 學校旅行：每架巴士載 55 人，有 4 架巴士，共有 208 個學生。全部人能上車嗎？剩幾個位？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）<span class="star">📝</span></div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)題（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>6 + 3 x 8 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>45 ÷ 5 - 6 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>(25 + 15) ÷ 8 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>32 - 4 x 6 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>判斷並改正：8 + 4 x 5 = 12 x 5 = 60。錯喺邊？寫出正確答案。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
